## Third-party material

1. **`data/templates/KDE_DeckList.pdf`** — Konami's official tournament deck
   registration form. It is **not included in this repository or the npm package**.
   `ygo fetch-data` downloads it from Konami on demand (or the user points
   `YGO_KDE_TEMPLATE` at a local copy); it is used only to fill a blank form.
2. **Procedure libraries** — the standard Fusion / Synchro / Xyz / Link procedures
   from [ProjectIgnis/CardScripts](https://github.com/ProjectIgnis/CardScripts)
   (GPL-3.0) are downloaded by `ygo fetch-data` into `data/ocgcore-scripts/`, not
   bundled. They let generated scripts resolve `Duel.LoadScript("proc_*.lua")` in
   YGO Omega and EDOPro.
3. **`test/fixtures/`** — synthetic responses shaped like Yuyu-tei, Konami, TCGCSV,
   TCGCorner, Format Library and Master Duel Meta payloads. They contain no
   captured third-party content and no personal data; see `test/fixtures/README.md`.
4. **Card names, card text, set names, rarities and card images** — owned by
   Konami Digital Entertainment, Shueisha, TV Tokyo and Studio Dice. The server
   references them for identification and analysis; images are linked, not
   bundled.
5. **Yugipedia text** — licensed **CC BY-SA 3.0** by its contributors. Wiki
   answers carry the source URL and licence; downstream reuse must keep the same
